<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 140 0 R
/E (As a bitcoiner, I spent years wondering why he didn't find btc worthy of remark in his analysis, given how compatible his framework is with btc's principles and ethos.  He'd get right to the edge and then turn away.  Of course, in the last year or so he has come around, though not so far as many bitcoiners would like.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
